OL,4,CHospital trust declares critical       
OL,5,Cincident                               
OL,6,GSherwood Forest Hospitals NHS          
OL,7,GFoundation Trust has declared a        
OL,8,Gcritical incident due to "sustained    
OL,9,Goperational pressures".                
OL,11,FThe trust, which runs King's Mill      
OL,12,FHospital in Sutton-in-Ashfield, Newark 
OL,13,FHospital and Mansfield Community       
OL,14,FHospital, announced the critical       
OL,15,Fincident in a statement on Wednesday   
OL,16,Fafternoon.                             
OL,18,FA spokesperson said: "Our hospitals    
OL,19,Fare here for you if you need them, but 
OL,20,Fplease be warned to expect delays      
OL,21,Fwhile we deal with this incident."     
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
